OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ABrazil election goes to run-off as
OL,4,Aright-wing Flavio Bolsonaro wins first
OL,5,Around
OL,6,
OL,7,FFlavio Bolsonaro is the son of the
OL,8,Fformer right-wing president Jair
OL,9,FBolsonaro, who is serving a 27-year
OL,10,Fprison sentence for masterminding a
OL,11,Ffailed coup attempt after losing the
OL,12,Flast election.
OL,14,FThe polls had suggested this race to be
OL,15,Fextremely close, with President Lula
OL,16,Ftypically polling slightly ahead. With
OL,17,F98.81% of the votes counted, Bolsonaro
OL,18,Fhad 47.24% to Lula's 44.91% of the
OL,19,Fvote.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
